A small **Zonerider** scene: a white ball, an #O(orange) swim ring and a light! The preview shows it in 3D (drag to turn it). Download `pool-toys.zr` and open it in [Zonerider](https://radii-office.com/zonerider/) with **File, Open**, or put it in Writeout or Bitbook as a **3D Scene**!

